-- a double count as data: two places in the family that are not the same place and hold the same
-- event. The published figure says nine pairs in ten were of this kind.
DoubleCount : (I : Type 0) → (V : Type 0) → (I → Measured V) → Type 0
DoubleCount I V f = (i : I) × (j : I) × (meas-event V (f i) ≡ meas-event V (f j)) × ((i ≡ j) → Empty)
